# configure MiST target to support neptUNO+ features
#
# neptUNO+ ships an RP2040 middle board running real MiST firmware, so this
# target reuses the genuine MiST io modules (target/mist).
#
# Pin-out and macro list: not from an official schematic, verify against
# real hardware before a release build.
#
# Direct upload stays enabled here (unlike sidi128/neptuno): the RP2040
# middle board shares SPI_SCK/SPI_DO between the normal MiST protocol and
# a microSD pass-through, selected by SPI_SS4 (see jtframe_neptunoplus_top.sv)
# - that mux needs SPI_SS4 wired as a real signal, which only happens with
# direct upload enabled.
MIST=1
MIST_I2S_AUDIO=1
MIST_VGA_8BIT=1

debug JTFRAME_NOSTA
